Third-party work this project is built on
-----------------------------------------

`crates/huckleberry-api` is a Rust **port of py-huckleberry-api by Woyken**:

    https://github.com/Woyken/py-huckleberry-api

That project did the hard part. Working out how Huckleberry's Firebase
application is put together, which collection holds what, what every field is
called, which units each one is in, and what sequence of writes the app
expects for each operation, is original research, and all of it is Woyken's.
This port translates that knowledge into Rust. It does not originate it.

Where this port deliberately differs from the original, `docs/api.md` says so
and says why. Everything else is a translation.

